 3BA0   00B8    '----- MapView: the m-key map screen. Five level plans (MAPL1..
                MAPB2, W/N.PIC):
 3BA0   00B8    '----- W = full plan (shown when the map item 16 is held), N = 
                fog (rooms solid).
 3BA0   00B8    '----- Without the map only VISITED rooms (vis bitmask = ob(64)
                ) are lifted from
 3BA0   00B8    '----- the W picture and pasted over the N one. Per-room layout
                 lives in
 3BA0   00B8    '----- MAPDAT.PAC: room,level,x0,y0,x1,y1,dotx,doty (level 1=L1
                 2=L2 3=L3 4=B1
 3BA0   00B8    '----- 5=B2). Red ring = viewed level; red dot on the plan = th
                e player (only
 3BA0   00B8    '----- when viewing his level); red dot beside the selector = h
                is level when
 3BA0   00B8    '----- viewing another. Click a selector label to switch level 
                (the plan slides
 3BA0   00B8    '----- in from above/below per the building direction); any key
                 or a click
 3BA0   00B8    '----- anywhere else closes. The caller reloads the room afterw
                ards.
